## Version history

Full detail in [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md).

| Version | Key change |
|---|---|
| **v4.0** | The NPU and hardware video encode, both enabled in-kernel and unused until now: `h96-npu`, `h96-npu-setup`, `h96-encode` |
