## About this repository

This repo publishes the **board bring-up sources**: device tree, overlays, kernel config
fragment, board file, the front-panel daemon, and the Bluetooth firmware, all under
GPL-2.0, so you can inspect them and build a matching image yourself with the official
Armbian build framework rather than trusting a binary.

Building from these sources reproduces the v3.1 feature set, which is open GPU, WiFi 6,
hardware video and the front panel, plus the HDMI EDID work documented in the changelog.
The userspace layer added from v3.2 onward is not published here yet, so for the full
v4.0 feature set use the pre-built release image. See [README.md](README.md) for the
build steps.

